# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  What NOT to send to GitHub
#
#  Everything listed here stays on this computer only.
#  Everything NOT listed here gets published.
#
#  Rule of thumb: if the website needs it to run, it is not here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ── Junk your computer creates by itself ──────────────────────
# macOS drops these into every folder you open in Finder.
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon?

# Windows and Linux equivalents, in case you ever work elsewhere.
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*~
.directory


# ── Editor and tool settings ──────────────────────────────────
# These are about YOUR setup, not about the website.
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
*.swp
*.swo
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project


# ── Your own scratch and draft files ──────────────────────────
# Start any experiment with an underscore and it stays private.
#   _test.html   _draft.html   _scratch.js   _notes.txt
#
# IMPORTANT: these patterns are deliberately narrow. Do NOT change
# them to a plain "_*", because one real thumbnail the site needs is
# named _hIeRYpy_Ak.jpg (that YouTube video's ID starts with an
# underscore) and a wider rule would silently leave it behind.
_*.html
_*.js
_*.css
_*.md
_*.txt
scratch/
draft/
drafts/


# ── Anything with a password or key in it ─────────────────────
# There are none today. This is a seatbelt for later.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
credentials.*


# ── Downloads and leftovers ───────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.old
*.orig
*.rej
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.rar
*.7z
*.dmg


# ── Programming leftovers ─────────────────────────────────────
# This website has no dependencies and no build step, so none of
# this should ever appear. Listed so an accidental "npm install"
# or a stray Python script cannot pollute the repository.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.npm/
dist/
build/
.cache/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/


# ── Original photographs, before resizing ─────────────────────
# Put the full-size camera files here and they stay off GitHub.
# Only the resized copies inside assets/img/ get published.
originals/
_originals/
